{
  "kind": "bounded CPU streaming Jacobian comparison; host wall time and separate allocated bytes, not a mobile/energy acceptance gate",
  "captured_utc": "2026-10-18T23:43:21.187423+00:00",
  "baseline_commit": "63350761",
  "candidate": "streaming Jacobian candidate identified by source_sha256",
  "host": "macOS-27.0.1-arm64-arm-64bit-Mach-O",
  "methodology": "Preserved release baseline binaries were verified against committed source hashes before editing. Identical probe source, allocator-disabled timing, four processes/version, ABBA twice; alternating per-process case order. Each case has a warmup and five samples at 16/32/48 cubed grids. Analytic output checks and output destruction are outside timing. Separate allocation builds supply allocated bytes, not peak RSS. Baseline gradient workers use scoped threads; candidate streams on one thread. Wall time does not measure aggregate worker CPU time; host affinity, thermal state and energy are uncontrolled.",
  "probe_source": "use gpui_dataset_transformation::{divergence, flow_diagnostics, q_criterion, vorticity};\nuse gpui_mesh::{Association, DataSet, Field};\nuse gpui_profiler::AllocProbe;\nuse std::{hint::black_box, time::Instant};\n\nfn check(output: &DataSet) {\n    output.validate().unwrap();\n    for name in [\"vorticity\", \"q_criterion\", \"divergence\"] {\n        let field = output.field(Association::Point, name).unwrap();\n        assert!(field.valid.is_none());\n        match name {\n            \"vorticity\" => assert!(field.as_vector().unwrap().iter().all(|v| v[0].abs() < 1e-10 && v[1].abs() < 1e-10 && (v[2] - 4.0).abs() < 1e-10)),\n            \"q_criterion\" => assert!(field.as_scalar().unwrap().iter().all(|q| (q - 4.0).abs() < 1e-10)),\n            _ => assert!(field.as_scalar().unwrap().iter().all(|d| d.abs() < 1e-10)),\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let reverse = std::env::args().nth(1).as_deref() == Some(\"reverse\");\n    for n in [16usize, 32, 48] {\n        let dataset = DataSet::structured_grid(\"flow\", [n; 3], [0.0; 3], [0.5; 3]).unwrap();\n        let vectors = dataset.positions.iter().map(|p| [-2.0 * p[1], 2.0 * p[0], 0.0]).collect::<Vec<_>>();\n        let dataset = dataset.with_field(Field::vector(\"velocity\", vectors));\n        let order = if reverse { [\"combined\", \"separate_chain\"] } else { [\"separate_chain\", \"combined\"] };\n        for case in order {\n            let operation = || if case == \"combined\" {\n                flow_diagnostics(&dataset, \"velocity\").unwrap()\n            } else {\n                let output = vorticity(&dataset, \"velocity\", \"vorticity\").unwrap();\n                let output = q_criterion(&output, \"velocity\", \"q_criterion\").unwrap();\n                divergence(&output, \"velocity\", \"divergence\").unwrap()\n            };\n            let warm = black_box(operation()); check(&warm); drop(warm);\n            let mut times = Vec::with_capacity(5);\n            let mut counts = Vec::with_capacity(5);\n            let mut bytes = Vec::with_capacity(5);\n            for _ in 0..5 {\n                let mut probe = AllocProbe::new();\n                let start = Instant::now();\n                let output = black_box(operation());\n                let elapsed = start.elapsed().as_nanos();\n                let sample = probe.sample(\"flow\");\n                times.push(elapsed); counts.push(sample.count); bytes.push(sample.bytes);\n                check(&output); drop(output);\n            }\n            println!(r#\"{{\"n\":{n},\"case\":\"{case}\",\"times_ns\":{times:?},\"allocation_calls\":{counts:?},\"allocated_bytes\":{bytes:?},\"allocator_instrumentation\":{}}}\"#, cfg!(feature=\"allocations\"));\n        }\n    }\n}\n",
